# Implementation Plan: Cleaning Agent Live Demo UI

## What We Are Building

A dedicated, self-contained **Cleaning Agent Demo Page** (`/clean`) that can be presented to your panel to demonstrate:
1. Upload a messy dataset (CSV or XLSX)
2. Watch the Cleaning Agent work **live** in real-time
3. See the data quality score **before and after**, with a breakdown
4. See each cleaning operation (column, strategy, rows affected) appear one-by-one as the agent applies them
5. See the final cleaned data in a preview table

This is completely standalone — it does NOT need Redis, Supabase, or any other service.

---

## How the Full Flow Works (End-to-End)

```
User drops CSV/XLSX file
        ↓
[POST /api/cleaning/run]  ← New FastAPI endpoint
        ↓
Backend: runs ingestion_node → cleaning_node (real pipeline)
        ↓
Backend: emits SSE events for each operation as it completes
        ↓
[GET /api/cleaning/{job_id}/stream]  ← SSE event stream
        ↓
Frontend: receives events one-by-one and renders live UI
        ↓
Final event: quality_score_after + cleaned data preview (first 20 rows)
```

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The backend endpoint will run the **real** `cleaning_node.py` pipeline you already have.
> No mocking. No simulation. It uses your actual LLMRouter → Ollama/Gemini → Polars code execution chain.

